Consider the prevailing market narrative this week: is it bullish, bearish, or neutral? Use news sentiment analysis tools to gauge the overall mood. Cross-reference this with sector-specific performance within the S&P 500. Identify sectors driving gains or losses and assess their sustainability. If a strong trend exists early in the week (Tuesday/Wednesday), with high trading volume and clear narrative alignment, reflect this in the conviction score. Assume some reversal towards Friday. Sentiment should bias toward the dominant trend, but avoid extremes early.